3. fflate — MIT License. Copyright (c) 2023 Arjun Barrett. https://github.com/101arrowz/fflate

4. Chess piece images (pieces/*.png) — the "Cburnett" set by Colin M.L. Burnett (Wikimedia Commons, en:User:Cburnett),
   which the author publishes under several licenses (GFDL, BSD, GPL v2-or-later, and CC BY-SA 3.0).
